WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/features/telemetry/components/SignalDiffTable.tsx — the power-user diff table that compares two
  point-in-time signal snapshots (Window A vs Window B) on the Signal Diff page. Wraps the shared
  <DataTable virtualized selectable="multi"> with the incident-grade columns:
    pin (PinButton, item_type='widget', context='signal-diff:vehicle:N') · name (mono) ·
    value_a "Window A" (formatRaw) · value_b "Window B" (formatRaw, emphasised) ·
    delta "Δ" (deltaLabel → none '—' / 'changed' amber / numeric "+d (+p%)" emerald-rose-muted) ·
    source_a "Src A" + source_b "Src B" (SourceLayerBadge L1/L2/LOG/STALE/— with formatAge tooltip).
  Above the table a legend hosts two HelpTooltips (Δ, "Src A / Src B"). Rows are sorted pinned-first then
  name; the name + delta columns are sortable. Empty message = filterActive ? "No signals match the
  current filter" : "No differences between the two snapshots"; loading = "Loading…".
  Pure helpers reproduced verbatim (the arithmetic is the contract): isFiniteNumber, asNumber
  (number | finite-numeric-string | bool→1/0 | else null), formatRaw (null/undefined '—', finite number
  fmtNumber else '—', bool true/false, string verbatim, object JSON), deltaLabel (both-numeric ⇒
  {delta=b−a, pct = a≠0 ? delta/|a|·100 : null}; equal-raw ⇒ none; else ⇒ change), and the shared
  SourceLayerBadge STYLE map + formatAge (<1s ms, <1m s.1, <1h min, <1d h.1, else d.1).
  Hooks : useTelemetry (the SignalDiffRow feed), useTranslation. Shared components : @/components/ui
          (DataTable, PinButton, HelpTooltip), @/components/data-display (SourceLayerBadge).
  i18n  : every signalDiff.* + help.signal.* + sourceLayer.* key from the source/sub-component promoted
          to the P1/S10 catalog (table "SignalDiffTable"); no English literal in native code.

