STATES (every state renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  → spinner + "Loading…" (web DataTable loading box; no legend, web returns early).
  empty    → friendly icon + filter-aware message ("No signals match the current filter" /
             "No differences between the two snapshots"), legend still shown above (web parity).
  error    → retryable error chrome (P4 leaf addition; the web delegates to its host page).
  content  → pin-first sortable table with all 7 web columns + the Δ legend.
  stale    → header/banner "Reconnecting — values may be stale" over cached rows.
  offline  → banner "Offline — showing last known values" over cached rows.

